{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.LeptonMesonParitySplit","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.LeptonMesonParitySplit","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ParitySplit.h2_unique_all_one_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ParitySplit.h2_unique_all_one_dim","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LeptonMesonParitySplit.lean#L70-L76","doc":"**H_2 is the distinguished C = bar level**: all-1-dim where H_3 is not.\nThis is the algebraic origin of the lepton/meson split, hence of the\nthree calibration sectors (real lepton scale + modulus + orthogonal\nmeson class). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ParitySplit.h3_not_all_one_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ParitySplit.h3_not_all_one_dim","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LeptonMesonParitySplit.lean#L67-L68","doc":"**H_3: NOT all 1-dimensional** — the (2,1) irrep is 2-dim (C ≠ bar — mesons). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ParitySplit.h2_all_one_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ParitySplit.h2_all_one_dim","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LeptonMesonParitySplit.lean#L64-L65","doc":"**H_2: every irrep is 1-dimensional** (C = bar — the lepton level). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ParitySplit.dimsH3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ParitySplit.dimsH3","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lea